# Design system

Tokens live in `src/design-system/theme.css` (`@theme`) and `src/design-system/motion.ts`. Use them; do not introduce new hex, springs, or typefaces.

- **Color:** `canvas` / `well` are white. Morph pills use `pill` + `stroke` + `--filter-lift` so they read on the card. `ink` / `mute` / `control` type, `danger` the only accent.
- **Type:** SF Pro Display for the page title (`font-display`, `tracking-display`); SF Pro Text everywhere else (`font-sans`).
- **Chrome:** Tailwind utilities. Morph geometry stays in `src/morph.css` and reads theme variables.
- **Motion:** springs from `SPEED` + `useSlowMotion().scale`. Press uses `MOTION.pressDuration`. Honor `prefers-reduced-motion` with `MOTION.reducedDuration` (no bounce). Never `transition: all`. Animate `transform` / `opacity` only.
- **Feel:** hover uses `MOTION.hoverScale`, press uses `MOTION.pressScale` on pointer-down (`MOTION.pressDuration`). Interruptible springs from the live value. Elevate morphs with `--filter-lift`, not a gray well.

```tsx
// ✅
<div className="rounded-well bg-well shadow-well text-ink" />

// ❌
<div style={{ background: "#eee", borderRadius: 16 }} />
```
